    <profile name="Brace of Pistols" id="785d-ab24-9662-f47d" hidden="false" page="155" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN154929" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A model with this special rule counts as being armed with two Shuriken Pistols and two Splinter Pistols, which do not need to be represended on the model and may be used in any combination in a given Shooting phase or Assault phase.</characteristic>
