      <rules>
        <rule name="Weaver of Runes" id="1b19-f417-93f5-3c77" hidden="false" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN111556">
          <description>By focusing his will upon an enemy threat, the Farseer guides the destructive beam of his accompanying Fire Prism with unerring accuracy. The Fire Prism&apos;s weapons all have the Twin-Linked special rule when targeting an enemy unit that the Runeweaver Host&apos;s Farseer has line of sight to.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
