      <rules>
        <rule name="The Fury of Khaine" id="b165-9661-77e4-4bb6" hidden="false" page="145" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN76419">
          <description>The Avatar has the Eternal Warrior special rule and cannot be wounded by any melta, plasma or flamer weapons. In addition, the range of both his Khaine Awakened rule and the Wailing Doom&apos;s weapon profile are increased to 24&quot;, and he gains a number of addition Attacks equal to the number of Phoenix Lords within 6&quot; of him.</description>
        </rule>
