      <rules>
        <rule name="The Strong Stand Alone" id="0cf5-4ff1-99d6-43d0" hidden="false" page="141" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN70264">
          <description>The Battlehost may include a single sqadron of Night Spinner, Fire Prism or Warp Hunter grav-tanks. This army may contain no other Detachments with the Eldar, Dark Eldar, Harlequin, or Eldar Corsairs Factions, save more Pale Courts Warhosts of an identical configuration.</description>
