          <description>The Battlehost must replace the Farseer with a Spiritseer or a Wraithseer, and may include 0-1 Wraithlord. If a Wraithlord or Wraithseer is chosen as the army&apos;s Warlord then two D6 are rolled to determine its Warlord Trait and the controlling player may select which result to use.</description>
